    <briefdescription>
<para>Terminal-specific modal wrapper over <ref refid="classjam_1_1_modal_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::ModalWindow</ref>. </para>
