<para>Delegates generic modal setup (L&amp;F inheritance, centring, glass, setVisible, enterModalState) to <ref refid="classjam_1_1_modal_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::ModalWindow</ref>&apos;s caller-ctor. Adds Terminal-specific Display::onRepaintNeeded callback and paint border.</para>
